+
+// ORO's (Ethan's) team for Daily Gold. This file is the one place to edit it.
+//
+// Species and order follow Ethan's team from Hall of Legends, with Umbreon
+// in the fourth slot. Every Pokemon is level 100 with perfect IVs.
+//
+// The battle itself is a normal FireRed trainer battle: the trainer entry
+// (name, class, sprite, AI flags) is TRAINER_DAILYRED_RED in
+// src/data/trainers.h.
+//
+// iv: 0-255, scaled to 0-31 by the game (255 = 31 in every stat).
+
+const struct TrainerMonItemCustomMoves gDailyRedBossParty[DAILYRED_BOSS_PARTY_SIZE] =
+{
